		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  [Résolu] migration Oracle Erreur d'extraction "Erreur de segmentation"]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=26717#p26717"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="quotebox"><cite>gleu a écrit&#160;:</cite><blockquote><div><p>Par dichotomie. Exporter la moitié de la table. Si jamais il n&#039;y a pas d&#039;erreur, faites l&#039;autre moitié de table. Quand vous trouvez une erreur, diviser le restant en deux, etc. Pas facile, pas amusant, mais pas d&#039;autres moyens.</p></div></blockquote></div><p>J&#039;ai l&#039;erreur de segmentation à partir de la 4ème ligne mais je ne vois rien de différents avec les autres lignes </p><br /><p>Ci-après la structure de la table :</p><br /><p>&#160; CREATE TABLE &quot;APW&quot;.&quot;OLE&quot; <br />&#160; &#160;(&#160; &#160; &quot;REFESOC&quot; VARCHAR2(3 BYTE) NOT NULL ENABLE, <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;RFENTLOS15&quot; VARCHAR2(2 BYTE) NOT NULL ENABLE, <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;RFREFE1OLE&quot; VARCHAR2(20 BYTE) NOT NULL ENABLE, <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;RFREFE2OLE&quot; VARCHAR2(20 BYTE) NOT NULL ENABLE, <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;RFREFE3OLE&quot; VARCHAR2(20 BYTE) NOT NULL ENABLE, <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;RFREFE4OLE&quot; VARCHAR2(20 BYTE) NOT NULL ENABLE, <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;RFREFE5OLE&quot; VARCHAR2(20 BYTE) NOT NULL ENABLE, <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;LVLIENOLE&quot; LONG RAW, <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;FGTAOLEOLE&quot; NUMBER(1,0), <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;LVNOTEOLE&quot; VARCHAR2(2000 BYTE), <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;ROWGSA&quot; VARCHAR2(25 BYTE), <br />&#160; &#160; &quot;LIENHYPERT&quot; VARCHAR2(2048 BYTE), <br />&#160; &#160;&#160; CONSTRAINT &quot;OLE_PK&quot; PRIMARY KEY (&quot;REFESOC&quot;, &quot;RFENTLOS15&quot;, &quot;RFREFE1OLE&quot;, &quot;RFREFE2OLE&quot;, &quot;RFREFE3OLE&quot;, &quot;RFREFE4OLE&quot;, &quot;RFREFE5OLE&quot;)<br />&#160; USING INDEX PCTFREE 10 INITRANS 2 MAXTRANS 255 COMPUTE STATISTICS <br />&#160; STORAGE(INITIAL 589824 NEXT 1048576 MINEXTENTS 1 MAXEXTENTS 2147483645<br />&#160; PCTINCREASE 0 FREELISTS 1 FREELIST GROUPS 1 BUFFER_POOL DEFAULT)<br />&#160; TABLESPACE &quot;TSAPW&quot;&#160; ENABLE, <br />&#160; &#160;&#160; CONSTRAINT &quot;OLE_SOC_FK01&quot; FOREIGN KEY (&quot;REFESOC&quot;)<br />&#160; &#160;&#160; &#160;REFERENCES &quot;APW&quot;.&quot;SOC&quot; (&quot;REFESOC&quot;) ON DELETE CASCADE ENABLE<br />&#160; &#160;) PCTFREE 10 PCTUSED 40 INITRANS 1 MAXTRANS 255 NOCOMPRESS LOGGING<br />&#160; STORAGE(INITIAL 5242880 NEXT 1048576 MINEXTENTS 1 MAXEXTENTS 2147483645<br />&#160; PCTINCREASE 0 FREELISTS 1 FREELIST GROUPS 1 BUFFER_POOL DEFAULT)<br />&#160; TABLESPACE &quot;TSAPW&quot; ;</p><br /><p>&#160; CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER &quot;APW&quot;.&quot;ROWID_OLE&quot; before update or insert on OLE for each row<br />declare<br />&#160; &#160; strRowid VARCHAR2(18);<br />&#160; &#160; nCount NUMBER(6);<br />begin</p><p>&#160; &#160; SELECT ROWIDTOCHAR(:new.rowid) INTO strRowid FROM dual;<br />&#160; &#160; nCount := TO_NUMBER( NVL ( SUBSTR( :old.rowgsa, 20, 6 ), &#039;0&#039; ) );<br />&#160; &#160; IF nCount = 999999 THEN<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; nCount := 0;<br />&#160; &#160; END IF;<br />&#160; &#160; nCount := nCount + 1;<br />&#160; &#160; :new.rowgsa := strRowid || &#039;-&#039; || SUBSTR(TO_CHAR( nCount, &#039;099999&#039; ), 2, 6 );</p><p>end;<br />/<br />ALTER TRIGGER &quot;APW&quot;.&quot;ROWID_OLE&quot; ENABLE;</p><br /><br /><br /><p>et les 4 premières lignes dont la dernière qui plante :</p><br /><p>Insert into OLE (REFESOC,RFENTLOS15,RFREFE1OLE,RFREFE2OLE,RFREFE3OLE,RFREFE4OLE,RFREFE5OLE,LVLIENOLE,FGTAOLEOLE,LVNOTEOLE,ROWGSA,LIENHYPERT) values (&#039;250&#039;,&#039;2&#039;,&#039;990000000110&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,null,&#039;0&#039;,null,&#039;00000000.0000.0000-000001&#039;,null);</p><br /><p>Insert into OLE (REFESOC,RFENTLOS15,RFREFE1OLE,RFREFE2OLE,RFREFE3OLE,RFREFE4OLE,RFREFE5OLE,LVLIENOLE,FGTAOLEOLE,LVNOTEOLE,ROWGSA,LIENHYPERT) values (&#039;520&#039;,&#039;2&#039;,&#039;450&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,null,&#039;0&#039;,&#039;2000/39<br />&#039;,&#039;00000000.0000.0000-000001&#039;,null);</p><br /><p>Insert into OLE (REFESOC,RFENTLOS15,RFREFE1OLE,RFREFE2OLE,RFREFE3OLE,RFREFE4OLE,RFREFE5OLE,LVLIENOLE,FGTAOLEOLE,LVNOTEOLE,ROWGSA,LIENHYPERT) values (&#039;520&#039;,&#039;2&#039;,&#039;200000000001&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,null,&#039;0&#039;,&#039;GBXGNBXNGN&#039;,&#039;00000000.0000.0000-000001&#039;,null);</p><br /><p>La dernière est celle qui fait planter l&#039;extraction par une erreur de segmentation : <br />Insert into OLE (REFESOC,RFENTLOS15,RFREFE1OLE,RFREFE2OLE,RFREFE3OLE,RFREFE4OLE,RFREFE5OLE,LVLIENOLE,FGTAOLEOLE,LVNOTEOLE,ROWGSA,LIENHYPERT) values (&#039;520&#039;,&#039;2&#039;,&#039;200000000002&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,&#039;*&#039;,null,&#039;0&#039;,null,&#039;00000000.0000.0000-000001&#039;,null);</p>]]></content>
